OL,3,AShein valued at $26bn after
OL,4,Along-awaited stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FUltra-fast-fashion brand Shein has been
OL,7,Fvalued at $26.2bn (#19.3bn) after its
OL,8,Ffirst day of public trading, following
OL,9,Fa long quest to list on the stock
OL,10,Fmarket.
OL,12,FThe company was once estimated to be
OL,13,Fworth nearly $100bn, but has faced
OL,14,Fheated competition, trade tensions and
OL,15,Fquestions over the ethics of its supply
OL,16,Fchain.
OL,18,FShein's share price fell in the early
OL,19,Fhours of trading but recovered ground
OL,20,Fbefore closing down just 0.12%.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
