OL,3,AShein valued at $26bn after
OL,4,Along-awaited stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company's attempts to list in the
OL,7,FUK and US were scuppered after supply
OL,8,Fchain concerns and criticism of its
OL,9,Fenvironmental impact.
